Z||000000||Tonker||09-14-2001||05:38 PM|||| <A HREF="http://www.cbc.ca/cgi-bin/templates/view.cgi?/news/2001/09/14/canmem_010914" TARGET=_blank>http://www.cbc.ca/cgi-bin/templates/view.cgi?/news/2001/09/14/canmem_010914</A>  <BR><A HREF="http://www.canada.com/ottawa/story.asp?id={3BBCEEFD-BCEA-4A74-9D70-7529F1652060}" TARGET=_blank>http://www.canada.com/ottawa/story.asp?id={3BBCEEFD-BCEA-4A74-9D70-7529F1652060}</A><BR><A HREF="http://ca.news.yahoo.com/010914/6/af1j.html" TARGET=_blank>http://ca.news.yahoo.com/010914/6/af1j.html</A> <P><BR>I was amazed at the number of people who arrived on Parliament Hill. I expected a large turn-out, but this was even more than we get on Canada Day.<BR><p>[This message has been edited by Tonker (edited 09-14-2001).]||||reg||1
